### The 100% Safe Solution: Java-Side Processing
To absolutely guarantee we **do not touch your original working SQL**, we will run your exact, original queries. We will then apply the searching (filtering) and pagination in **Java memory**.
Because this is a workflow queue (which typically has hundreds or thousands of rows per user, not millions), Java can filter and paginate this in 1-2 milliseconds. This completely bypasses Oracle's redaction errors.
